+# PLAN: JSONL text_mode (#184)
+
+Status: draft
+Specs: [SPEC-jsonl-text-mode.md](../specs/SPEC-jsonl-text-mode.md)
+
+1. Add `TextMode`, `text_mode` on `CustomAgentSpec`, and extend `ReplyCollector` (FR-2450, FR-2451).
+2. Add `interim_unfinished` collector signal, `AgentErrorKind::InterimUnfinished`, and gate in `run_turn` (FR-2452).
+3. Set opencode preset to `concat` + `text_break_when` for `tool_use` (FR-2453).
+4. Tests TC-2450..TC-2454; adjust FR-2442 integration to set `text_mode = concat`.
+5. Document in `docs/agents/custom-agents.md` and spec artifacts.
+
+## Rollback
+
+Remove `text_mode` handling from `ReplyCollector` (revert to unconditional append) and delete `interim_unfinished` check.
